;; expect: main.use runnable no_l_identity
;; a structure with a function-typed field and a field of its own type is no package and no E
;; type: reading its fields for a package comes back to the type itself, and the reading ends
;; at the depth it is given (erase.shard package_type) — a function over it is a program, as
;; over any type that is neither
(inductive P () Type (mk (-> (-> Int Int) P P)))
(fn use ((p P) (x Int)) Int x)
